# Every upstream font file, by SHA-256, relative to web/vendor/.
#
# This is why the font itself need not be committed: what scripts/fetch-font.sh
# obtains is provably the file this repository was built against, and a font that
# drifted upstream says so rather than quietly changing how a worksheet is set.
#
# Regenerate after a deliberate version change:
#   (cd web/vendor && sha256sum *.woff2 OFL.txt)
094191335def3f0452c81ec0713cfc2f29bb6af8cecbf79b60881fbf2db97562  STIXTwoMath-Regular.woff2
0c8825913b60d858aacdb33c4ca6660a7d64b0d6464702efbb19313f5765861a  OFL.txt
e2a13a91ad5d98da25a6972e8b19ce216e1997037004d9051290d0094b10a58b  STIXTwoText-Variable.woff2
a5e3f5f788a93cd23f015f6d6e1cc64b3239ad0a798aec5032c6be18e165f78d  STIXTwoText-Italic-Variable.woff2
